## Runtime data (artifacts, sqlite db, steamcmd, logs)
## Anchored patterns: an unanchored `data/` also matched the SOURCE folder
## src/GmodAddonAnalyzer/Data/ on case-insensitive filesystems
## (core.ignorecase=true), so the entities were silently never committed.
## This repo sets core.ignorecase=false to keep them apart.
/data/
/src/GmodAddonAnalyzer/data/
# On case-insensitive filesystems the app's runtime "./data" collides with the
# source "Data/" directory, so the runtime entries land inside it. Ignore them
# by exact (lowercase) name -- core.ignorecase=false keeps these from shadowing
# source files.
/src/GmodAddonAnalyzer/Data/artifacts/
/src/GmodAddonAnalyzer/Data/logs/
/src/GmodAddonAnalyzer/Data/steamcmd/
/src/GmodAddonAnalyzer/Data/analyzer.db*

